  "description_short": "Garden Route gourmet sandwiches with inventive fillings and fresh ingredients in a relaxed Wilderness setting.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away on Leila's Lane in Wilderness, Jammwich has built a loyal following with its creative approach to the humble sandwich. The menu goes well beyond the basics, featuring inventive combinations that showcase fresh, quality ingredients — think slow-roasted meats, homemade spreads, and generous fillings that actually taste like something. The vibe is casual and unpretentious, perfect for a quick lunch break or a lazy morning bite.\n\nWhat sets this spot apart is the attention to detail in every sandwich. The bread is fresh, the flavours are balanced, and portions are generous without being wasteful. It's the kind of place where locals pop in regularly because they know exactly what they're getting: honest food done properly. Whether you're passing through Wilderness or looking for a reliable lunch spot, Jammwich delivers consistency and flavour without any fuss.",
